## Architectural References (No Code Copied)

- **Model Context Protocol (MCP)**: Clean-room implementation of the Streamable HTTP (`2025-03-26` / `2025-11-25`) client and server transport over Apple's native `Network.framework` (`NWListener`) and `URLSession`.
- **Android Eta / Agent Design**: Native-first OS tool routing before GUI fallback, strict bounded memory/log governance, and queue/steer loop control.
- **Developer Disk Images**: Downloaded on-device at runtime from [doronz88/DeveloperDiskImage](https://github.com/doronz88/DeveloperDiskImage) or imported manually from Xcode.
